{
    "title": "Word Blast: Word Search Games",
    "description": "WELCOME TO THE ULTIMATE FREE WORD GAME ADVENTURE!\r\n\r\nWord Blast, an amazing free word game from the creator of Word Serenity and Word Tile Puzzle, is your final destination of word search puzzles.\r\n\r\nLike playing innovative free word games? Word Blast is guaranteed to make your day!\r\n\r\nThe new free word game is full of delightful game modes, features and challenges. Search and blast words to unlock rewards, themes and new features. The more words you blast, the more Wisdom points you\u2019ll get on the game board.\r\n\r\nWith your favorite free word game modes and numerous innovative ideas, you may find this word game more fun than ever! Word Blast is a modern twist on classic word games!\r\n\r\nThere are countless possibilities in this word search game, and your wisdom in solving puzzles will be the key to mastering Word Blast. If you\u2019d like to relax and unwind with free word games, you\u2019ll love Word Blast!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\n\u25cf Perfect match of word games and tiles!\r\n\r\n\u25cf Complete 10000+ challenging puzzles and unlock new Themes!\r\n\r\n\u25cf Enjoy the unique gameplay, beautiful backgrounds and relaxing music!\r\n\r\n\u25cf Unlock powerful boosters to beat the next puzzle!\r\n\r\n\u25cf Challenge various quests to win awesome rewards!\r\n\r\n\u25cf Receive gifts from Daily Reward and Daily Puzzles to keep on playing!\r\n\r\n\u25cf Sync your game progress easily between your phone and tablet!\r\n\r\n\u25cf Easy and fun to play yet challenging to master!\r\n\r\n\u25cf Search for words with no time limit!\r\n\r\nDownload now to start your word search adventure! Sharpen your mind and become a true Word Master with this creative free word game.\r\n\r\nTerms: http://www.histudiogames.com/terms/\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: http://www.histudiogames.com/privacy/",
